&lt;li&gt;Building and scaling a best-in-class sales team within the gaming vertical across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will define and execute effective and repeatable sales motions and operational processes tailored to EMEA markets. You will apply an account planning process to prioritize accounts, grow revenue, educate clients, lead strategic client conversations, and navigate complex relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
