&lt;li&gt;You will become an expert in Discord solutions and adapt recommendations to suit varying client needs within diverse EMEA markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for consulting with clients and contributing to marketing and media plans that enables them to reach their target gaming audiences on Discord across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will demonstrate expertise around the gaming, media, and marketing spaces to clients, within Discord, and in industry forums throughout the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will manage and grow a team of Account Executives and Account Managers focused on the EMEA gaming vertical.&lt;/li&gt;
