&lt;li&gt;Develop mastery of, and help shape, industry best practices for safe and responsible revenue product development through research and writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the crossfunctional group to evaluate the policy and enforcement impacts on new product changes, and scope the necessary requirements to support those teams.&lt;br&gt;Support the development of responsible product development content, such as training, guides, talking points, strategies, and presentations, for engagement with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write user-facing communications to explain our products and safety features through blog posts, Help Center Articles, and other resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: Potential exposure to sensitive or graphic content, including but not limited to vulgar language, violent threats, pornography and other graphic images.&lt;/p&gt;
