&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working on revenue/commerce products and operations in the context of social tech (communications services; social media; etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience addressing issues in responsible product development, trust &amp;amp; safety product strategy, product risk assessment, or developing monetization policies ideally within tech or related industry groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent education / experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for understanding and mitigating the unintended impact of the online communication services on users and society.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with product, engineering, design, research partners, or multiple stakeholders at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
